, "seatId": "s5"}, "text": "You are Omar. Your secret role is DOCTOR.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "payload": {"role": "doctor"}}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 6, "day": 0, "phase": "setup", "type": "role_reveal", "visibility": {"kind": "seat", "seatId": "s6"}, "text": "You are Kai. Your secret role is DETECTIVE.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "payload": {"role": "detective"}}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 7, "day": 0, "phase": "setup", "type": "team_reveal", "visibility": {"kind": "team", "team": "mafia"}, "text": "The mafia team is: Leo and Priya.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "payload": {"mafiaSeatIds": ["s3", "s4"]}}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 8, "day": 1, "phase": "night", "type": "phase", "visibility": {"kind": "public"}, "text": "Night 1 falls. Everyone closes their eyes.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "payload": {"phase": "night", "day": 1}}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 9, "day": 1, "phase": "night", "type": "mafia_chat", "visibility": {"kind": "team", "team": "mafia"}, "text": "Ines has been way too quiet", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s4", "payload": {"suggests": "s2"}}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 10, "day": 1, "phase": "night", "type": "thought", "visibility": {"kind": "spectator"}, "text": "rolling dice", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s4", "payload": {"forType": "mafia_chat"}, "replyToSeq": 9}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 11, "day": 1, "phase": "night", "type": "mafia_chat", "visibility": {"kind": "team", "team": "mafia"}, "text": "I'm town, I promise. Look at Priya instead.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s3", "payload": {"suggests": "s4"}}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 12, "day": 1, "phase": "night", "type": "thought", "visibility": {"kind": "spectator"}, "text": "rolling dice", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s3", "payload": {"forType": "mafia_chat"}, "replyToSeq": 11}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 13, "day": 1, "phase": "night", "type": "kill_vote", "visibility": {"kind": "team", "team": "mafia"}, "text": "Priya wants to kill Kai.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s4", "targetSeatId": "s6"}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 14, "day": 1, "phase": "night", "type": "thought", "visibility": {"kind": "spectator"}, "text": "random pick", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s4", "payload": {"forType": "kill_vote"}, "replyToSeq": 13}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 15, "day": 1, "phase": "night", "type": "kill_vote", "visibility": {"kind": "team", "team": "mafia"}, "text": "Leo wants to kill Ines.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s3", "targetSeatId": "s2"}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 16, "day": 1, "phase": "night", "type": "thought", "visibility": {"kind": "spectator"}, "text": "random pick", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s3", "payload": {"forType": "kill_vote"}, "replyToSeq": 15}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 17, "day": 1, "phase": "night", "type": "save", "visibility": {"kind": "seat", "seatId": "s5"}, "text": "You protected Rafi tonight.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s5", "targetSeatId": "s1"}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 18, "day": 1, "phase": "night", "type": "thought", "visibility": {"kind": "spectator"}, "text": "Night 1, no information yet. I'm the doctor and can protect anyone. No one has claimed detective or spoken, so there's no obvious loud target. Protecting myself is an option but self-protection is usually weak; better to pick a random non-self player. Rafi is a reasonable guess with no evidence either way. I'll protect Rafi.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s5", "payload": {"forType": "save"}, "replyToSeq": 17}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 19, "day": 1, "phase": "night", "type": "investigate_result", "visibility": {"kind": "seat", "seatId": "s6"}, "text": "Investigation: Rafi is NOT mafia.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s6", "targetSeatId": "s1", "payload": {"isMafia": false}}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 20, "day": 1, "phase": "night", "type": "thought", "visibility": {"kind": "spectator"}, "text": "Night 1, no information yet. Pick someone other than myself. Choosing Rafi as an arbitrary first check.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s6", "payload": {"forType": "investigate_result"}, "replyToSeq": 19}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 21, "day": 1, "phase": "night", "type": "death", "visibility": {"kind": "public"}, "text": "Morning comes. Kai was found dead. They were DETECTIVE.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "targetSeatId": "s6", "payload": {"role": "detective"}}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 22, "day": 1, "phase": "day", "type": "phase", "visibility": {"kind": "public"}, "text": "Day 1. Discuss. Alive: Rafi, Ines, Leo, Priya, Omar", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "payload": {"phase": "day", "day": 1}}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 23, "day": 1, "phase": "day", "type": "speech", "visibility": {"kind": "public"}, "text": "Kai was the detective and they're gone already. Great start, mafia. Nobody say anything dumb yet, I want to see who talks too much.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s2"}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 24, "day": 1, "phase": "day", "type": "thought", "visibility": {"kind": "spectator"}, "text": "Kai was the detective and got killed night 1, so mafia took them out. I have no info. Keep it short, no accusations yet, just observe. Maybe ask who spoke oddly.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s2", "payload": {"forType": "speech"}, "replyToSeq": 23}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 25, "day": 1, "phase": "day", "type": "speech", "visibility": {"kind": "public"}, "text": "Rough start, Kai's gone and that stings. No alpha move is worth a wild vote on day one, so let's hear everyone out before we trade anyone. Who has a real read?", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s5"}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 26, "day": 1, "phase": "day", "type": "thought", "visibility": {"kind": "spectator"}, "text": "Kai was detective and died night 1, so the mafia killed them. I'm doctor; I protected Rafi, so I shouldn't reveal yet. Don't claim, stay low, watch for who pushes votes. No strong read yet. Keep it casual with the alpha tone.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s5", "payload": {"forType": "speech"}, "replyToSeq": 25}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 27, "day": 1, "phase": "day", "type": "speech", "visibility": {"kind": "public"}, "text": "Rough loss, Kai was a big one to lose. Let's hear everyone out before anyone gets pinned. Ines, Leo, Priya, what did you each notice in the first messages?", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s1"}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 28, "day": 1, "phase": "day", "type": "thought", "visibility": {"kind": "spectator"}, "text": "Kai was detective and got killed night one, so mafia targeted them. I have no info. Personality: conflict-avoidant, let's hear everyone out. Stay neutral, ask for reads without accusing anyone yet.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s1", "payload": {"forType": "speech"}, "replyToSeq": 27}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 29, "day": 1, "phase": "day", "type": "speech", "visibility": {"kind": "public"}, "text": "I'm town, I promise. Look at Omar instead.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s4", "payload": {"accuses": "s5"}}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 30, "day": 1, "phase": "day", "type": "thought", "visibility": {"kind": "spectator"}, "text": "rolling dice", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s4", "payload": {"forType": "speech"}, "replyToSeq": 29}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 31, "day": 1, "phase": "day", "type": "speech", "visibility": {"kind": "public"}, "text": "I'm town, I promise. Look at Ines instead.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s3", "payload": {"accuses": "s2"}}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 32, "day": 1, "phase": "day", "type": "thought", "visibility": {"kind": "spectator"}, "text": "rolling dice", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s3", "payload": {"forType": "speech"}, "replyToSeq": 31}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 33, "day": 1, "phase": "day", "type": "speech", "visibility": {"kind": "public"}, "text": "Leo, you went after me in one message with zero reason. Explain that. Priya, why Omar specifically? Give me something real, not a one-liner.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s2", "payload": {"accuses": "s3"}}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 34, "day": 1, "phase": "day", "type": "thought", "visibility": {"kind": "spectator"}, "text": "Day 1, no info. Leo and Priya both deflect onto others fast. Priya pushes Omar, Leo pushes me. Omar and Rafi are playing the calm-moderator role. Not enough to accuse yet; I'll call out Leo's quick deflection and ask for reasons.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s2", "payload": {"forType": "speech"}, "replyToSeq": 33}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 35, "day": 1, "phase": "day", "type": "speech", "visibility": {"kind": "public"}, "text": "Priya and Leo both just pointed at someone with one line each, which I don't love. Ines is asking for real reasons, and I agree with that. Can Priya and Leo each explain their read before we vote on anyone?", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s1", "payload": {"accuses": "s4"}}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 36, "day": 1, "phase": "day", "type": "thought", "visibility": {"kind": "spectator"}, "text": "I'm a villager with no info. Priya and Leo are deflecting onto each other, which is suspicious but could be either mafia pair. Ines is pressing well. Keep it calm, ask for reasons, don't commit to a vote yet.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s1", "payload": {"forType": "speech"}, "replyToSeq": 35}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 37, "day": 1, "phase": "day", "type": "speech", "visibility": {"kind": "public"}, "text": "Agreed with Rafi and Ines, one-line accusations are a cheap move. Priya, why me specifically? Leo, what's your real read on Ines beyond that one message? Let's get real reasons before any vote.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s5", "payload": {"accuses": "s4"}}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 38, "day": 1, "phase": "day", "type": "thought", "visibility": {"kind": "spectator"}, "text": "I'm the doctor, protected Rafi last night. Priya and Leo both deflected onto others with one-liners; that smells mafia-ish, and they're pointing at me and Ines. I shouldn't claim doctor yet. Push them to explain, stay neutral, lean on Rafi's point.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s5", "payload": {"forType": "speech"}, "replyToSeq": 37}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 39, "day": 1, "phase": "day", "type": "speech", "visibility": {"kind": "public"}, "text": "Priya has been way too quiet", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s3", "payload": {"accuses": "s4"}}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 40, "day": 1, "phase": "day", "type": "thought", "visibility": {"kind": "spectator"}, "text": "rolling dice", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s3", "payload": {"forType": "speech"}, "replyToSeq": 39}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 41, "day": 1, "phase": "day", "type": "speech", "visibility": {"kind": "public"}, "text": "I'm town, I promise. Look at Omar instead.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s4", "payload": {"accuses": "s5"}}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 42, "day": 1, "phase": "day", "type": "thought", "visibility": {"kind": "spectator"}, "text": "rolling dice", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s4", "payload": {"forType": "speech"}, "replyToSeq": 41}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 43, "day": 1, "phase": "vote", "type": "phase", "visibility": {"kind": "public"}, "text": "Voting time. Each player votes to eliminate someone.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "payload": {"phase": "vote", "day": 1}}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 44, "day": 1, "phase": "vote", "type": "vote", "visibility": {"kind": "public"}, "text": "Rafi votes for Leo.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s1", "targetSeatId": "s3"}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 45, "day": 1, "phase": "vote", "type": "thought", "visibility": {"kind": "spectator"}, "text": "Leo and Priya both made one-line accusations and kept repeating \"I'm town\" without reasons. Priya's line pushed Omar, Leo's pushed Ines, and they seem to be coordinating deflection. Leo's \"Priya has been too quiet\" is weak. Ines and Omar both pushed for real reasons and seem fine. I'll vote Leo, the most suspicious based on the cheap accusation and repeated pattern.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s1", "payload": {"forType": "vote"}, "replyToSeq": 44}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 46, "day": 1, "phase": "vote", "type": "vote", "visibility": {"kind": "public"}, "text": "Omar votes for Leo.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s5", "targetSeatId": "s3"}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 47, "day": 1, "phase": "vote", "type": "thought", "visibility": {"kind": "spectator"}, "text": "Mafia are likely Leo and Priya (both deflected with one-liners, and they pushed onto me and Ines). Rafi already voted Leo. Voting Leo as a trade with Rafi keeps town together; no reason to hit Ines or Rafi. I'm the doctor, so I stay quiet about my role.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s5", "payload": {"forType": "vote"}, "replyToSeq": 46}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 48, "day": 1, "phase": "vote", "type": "vote", "visibility": {"kind": "public"}, "text": "Leo votes for Rafi.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s3", "targetSeatId": "s1"}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 49, "day": 1, "phase": "vote", "type": "thought", "visibility": {"kind": "spectator"}, "text": "random pick", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s3", "payload": {"forType": "vote"}, "replyToSeq": 48}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 50, "day": 1, "phase": "vote", "type": "vote", "visibility": {"kind": "public"}, "text": "Ines votes for Leo.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s2", "targetSeatId": "s3"}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 51, "day": 1, "phase": "vote", "type": "thought", "visibility": {"kind": "spectator"}, "text": "Leo has pushed me with no reason and dodged Priya's pressure, then voted Rafi. Rafi and Omar both voted Leo already. Piling on Leo gives a clear plurality. Priya is also suspicious, but Leo is the most obvious mafia-looking player right now.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s2", "payload": {"forType": "vote"}, "replyToSeq": 50}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 52, "day": 1, "phase": "vote", "type": "vote", "visibility": {"kind": "public"}, "text": "Priya votes for Omar.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s4", "targetSeatId": "s5"}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 53, "day": 1, "phase": "vote", "type": "thought", "visibility": {"kind": "spectator"}, "text": "random pick", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s4", "payload": {"forType": "vote"}, "replyToSeq": 52}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 54, "day": 1, "phase": "vote", "type": "eliminated", "visibility": {"kind": "public"}, "text": "Leo is eliminated by vote. They were MAFIA.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "targetSeatId": "s3", "payload": {"role": "mafia"}}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 55, "day": 2, "phase": "night", "type": "phase", "visibility": {"kind": "public"}, "text": "Night 2 falls. Everyone closes their eyes.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "payload": {"phase": "night", "day": 2}}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 56, "day": 2, "phase": "night", "type": "mafia_chat", "visibility": {"kind": "team", "team": "mafia"}, "text": "idk, something feels off about Omar", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s4", "payload": {"suggests": "s5"}}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 57, "day": 2, "phase": "night", "type": "thought", "visibility": {"kind": "spectator"}, "text": "rolling dice", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s4", "payload": {"forType": "mafia_chat"}, "replyToSeq": 56}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 58, "day": 2, "phase": "night", "type": "kill_vote", "visibility": {"kind": "team", "team": "mafia"}, "text": "Priya wants to kill Rafi.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s4", "targetSeatId": "s1"}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 59, "day": 2, "phase": "night", "type": "thought", "visibility": {"kind": "spectator"}, "text": "random pick", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s4", "payload": {"forType": "kill_vote"}, "replyToSeq": 58}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 60, "day": 2, "phase": "night", "type": "save", "visibility": {"kind": "seat", "seatId": "s5"}, "text": "You protected Ines tonight.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s5", "targetSeatId": "s2"}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 61, "day": 2, "phase": "night", "type": "thought", "visibility": {"kind": "spectator"}, "text": "I'm the doctor, Omar. I can't protect the same player two nights running, and I protected Rafi last night, so Rafi is out. Alive: Ines, Priya, Rafi. Leo was mafia and is dead, so one mafia remains, and Priya is the only one who has pushed a vote on me. Priya's behavior looks mafia-like, deflecting onto me and voting for me. Ines has been sharp and led the pushback against the accusations. The mafia will likely target the most vocal town voice, which is Ines. Protecting Ines is the best guess. Rafi is not a valid choice tonight anyway.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s5", "payload": {"forType": "save"}, "replyToSeq": 60}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 62, "day": 2, "phase": "night", "type": "death", "visibility": {"kind": "public"}, "text": "Morning comes. Rafi was found dead. They were VILLAGER.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "targetSeatId": "s1", "payload": {"role": "villager"}}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 63, "day": 2, "phase": "day", "type": "phase", "visibility": {"kind": "public"}, "text": "Day 2. Discuss. Alive: Ines, Priya, Omar", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "payload": {"phase": "day", "day": 2}}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 64, "day": 2, "phase": "day", "type": "speech", "visibility": {"kind": "public"}, "text": "Leo was mafia, so Rafi's death means the other mafia is still here, and Priya has been the one dodging real reads while pushing me with one-liners. Ines has been asking the right questions, so I'm reading Priya as mafia. Priya, explain yourself.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s5", "payload": {"accuses": "s4"}}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 65, "day": 2, "phase": "day", "type": "thought", "visibility": {"kind": "spectator"}, "text": "Alive: Ines, Priya, Omar (me). Mafia were Leo (dead) and one of Ines/Priya. Rafi was villager, killed at night. Priya pushed me hard on day 1 with one-liners and voted me; Ines has been the sharp one and suspicious of Leo, who was mafia. Ines is likely town, Priya likely mafia. I'm doctor, so I shouldn't claim. Accuse Priya, keep it casual with alpha flavor.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s5", "payload": {"forType": "speech"}, "replyToSeq": 64}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 66, "day": 2, "phase": "day", "type": "speech", "visibility": {"kind": "public"}, "text": "Omar has been way too quiet", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s4", "payload": {"accuses": "s5"}}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 67, "day": 2, "phase": "day", "type": "thought", "visibility": {"kind": "spectator"}, "text": "rolling dice", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s4", "payload": {"forType": "speech"}, "replyToSeq": 66}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 68, "day": 2, "phase": "day", "type": "speech", "visibility": {"kind": "public"}, "text": "Priya's \"way too quiet\" line is Leo's exact phrasing from earlier. Copy-paste mafia behavior. Priya, explain why you copied him, and why you voted Omar with no reason on day one.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s2", "payload": {"accuses": "s4", "claimRole": "villager"}}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 69, "day": 2, "phase": "day", "type": "thought", "visibility": {"kind": "spectator"}, "text": "Alive: Ines (me, villager), Priya, Omar. Mafia remaining: Priya and Omar (Leo was mafia, Rafi was villager, Kai detective). So one of Priya/Omar is mafia... actually 2 mafia total: Leo and one of Priya/Omar. Wait, 2 mafia: Leo + one more. Remaining mafia is Priya or Omar. Priya's one-liners mirror Leo's pattern; Priya voted Omar on day 1 and Leo said Priya was quiet, Priya was the one who echoed Leo's \"I'm town\" line. Omar has been the one asking for real reasons and reading. Priya's \"Omar has been way too quiet\" copies Leo's wording. Lean Priya.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s2", "payload": {"forType": "speech"}, "replyToSeq": 68}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 70, "day": 2, "phase": "day", "type": "speech", "visibility": {"kind": "public"}, "text": "Ines is giving mafia energy fr", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s4", "payload": {"accuses": "s2"}}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 71, "day": 2, "phase": "day", "type": "thought", "visibility": {"kind": "spectator"}, "text": "rolling dice", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s4", "payload": {"forType": "speech"}, "replyToSeq": 70}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 72, "day": 2, "phase": "day", "type": "speech", "visibility": {"kind": "public"}, "text": "Priya's \"way too quiet\" line is the same copy-paste Leo used, and she voted me with zero reason on day one. That's a mafia trade I'm not buying. Ines has been asking for real reads all game, so I'm backing her. Priya, one real reason, go.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s5", "payload": {"accuses": "s4"}}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 73, "day": 2, "phase": "day", "type": "thought", "visibility": {"kind": "spectator"}, "text": "Alive: Ines, Priya, Omar (me). Mafia remaining: Priya and one of... wait, 2 mafia total: Leo dead, so one mafia left among Ines and Priya. Priya's copied phrasing and day-1 vote on me point to her. Ines has been pushing reasons, consistent with town. Accuse Priya. Keep doctor secret; no claim.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s5", "payload": {"forType": "speech"}, "replyToSeq": 72}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 74, "day": 2, "phase": "day", "type": "speech", "visibility": {"kind": "public"}, "text": "Priya copied Leo's exact line and still hasn't given one real reason. That's enough for me. Priya's my vote today.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s2", "payload": {"accuses": "s4"}}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 75, "day": 2, "phase": "day", "type": "thought", "visibility": {"kind": "spectator"}, "text": "Mafia remaining: Priya and Omar (Leo was mafia, Rafi and Kai town). Omar is pushing me to vote Priya; Priya is pushing Omar. One of them is mafia, the other town-ish. Omar's day 1 reasoning was consistent; Priya's copy of Leo's line and zero reasons look mafia. Lean Priya. Vote Priya, accuse her.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s2", "payload": {"forType": "speech"}, "replyToSeq": 74}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 76, "day": 2, "phase": "vote", "type": "phase", "visibility": {"kind": "public"}, "text": "Voting time. Each player votes to eliminate someone.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "payload": {"phase": "vote", "day": 2}}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 77, "day": 2, "phase": "vote", "type": "vote", "visibility": {"kind": "public"}, "text": "Omar votes for Priya.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s5", "targetSeatId": "s4"}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 78, "day": 2, "phase": "vote", "type": "thought", "visibility": {"kind": "spectator"}, "text": "Alive: Ines, Priya, Omar (me). Mafia were Leo (dead) and one more. Rafi was villager, so mafia remaining is Priya or Ines. Priya copied Leo's line and voted me with no reason; Ines has been pushing reads. Priya is the likely mafia. Vote Priya.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s5", "payload": {"forType": "vote"}, "replyToSeq": 77}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 79, "day": 2, "phase": "vote", "type": "vote", "visibility": {"kind": "public"}, "text": "Ines votes for Priya.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s2", "targetSeatId": "s4"}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 80, "day": 2, "phase": "vote", "type": "thought", "visibility": {"kind": "spectator"}, "text": "Mafia are Leo (dead) and one of Priya/Omar since Rafi was killed by night and Kai was detective. Priya copied Leo's line and voted Omar with no reason; Omar backed me. Priya is the likely mafia. Vote Priya.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s2", "payload": {"forType": "vote"}, "replyToSeq": 79}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 81, "day": 2, "phase": "vote", "type": "vote", "visibility": {"kind": "public"}, "text": "Priya votes for Omar.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s4", "targetSeatId": "s5"}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 82, "day": 2, "phase": "vote", "type": "thought", "visibility": {"kind": "spectator"}, "text": "random pick", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "actorSeatId": "s4", "payload": {"forType": "vote"}, "replyToSeq": 81}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 83, "day": 2, "phase": "vote", "type": "eliminated", "visibility": {"kind": "public"}, "text": "Priya is eliminated by vote. They were MAFIA.", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "targetSeatId": "s4", "payload": {"role": "mafia"}}, {"gameId": "h2h-e2e-s1-b-mafia", "seq": 84, "day": 2, "phase": "end", "type": "game_over", "visibility": {"kind": "public"}, "text": "TOWN WINS. Roles were: Rafi (villager), Ines (villager), Leo (mafia), Priya (mafia), Omar (doctor), Kai (detective)", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T17:55:42.368Z", "payload": {"outcome": "town", "roles": {"s1": "villager", "s2": "villager", "s3": "mafia", "s4": "mafia", "s5": "doctor", "s6": "detective"}}}], "agentCalls": [{"gameId": "h2h_claude-haiku-vs-random_classic6_s1.s1.b-mafia", "seq": 17, "seatId": "s5", "modelId": "claude-haiku", "promptVersion": "p1", "inputTokens": 1315, "outputTokens": 166, "costUsd": 0.0002145, "latencyMs": 1358, "retries": 0, "fallback": false}, {"gameId": "h2h_claude-haiku-vs-random_classic6_s1.s1.b-mafia", "seq": 19, "seatId": "s6", "modelId": "claude-haiku", "promptVersion": "p1", "inputTokens": 1290, "outputTokens": 94, "costUsd": 0.000176, "latencyMs": 1124, "retries": 0, "fallback": false}, {"gameId": "h2h_claude-haiku-vs-random_classic6_s1.s1.b-mafia", "seq": 23, "seatId": "s2", "modelId": 